        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  1st run: leave the file empty -> <project>_REVISIONS.xlsx is made next to the .rvt from the Revit revisions\nThen Browse... to that Excel.  REVISIONS tab: P01, P02 ... / C01 ... with date + description.  Run once -> SHEETS tab gets a column per revision.\nType X under a revision for every sheet that carries it, save + close, Run.  Each sheet's Revision text = its latest revision (used by CAD2BIM_Export_PDF_DWG).",
